   "source": [
    "# Linear vs Multiple Regression Project\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "To understand the difference between simple and multiple regression,\n",
    "and analyze how adding variables affects coefficients, R², and Adjusted R²."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "26c2c78d-e874-47f8-bc97-28fcb63b23ad",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
